{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260523230418b1a846d5aa554e0c","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both CLI tools are installed but there are no cookies. I need to authenticate. Let me try the Open Douyin API approach first with AppID + AppSecret to get an access_token, then use tma to upload.\n\nFrom the docs:\n- `tma set-app-config <appId> --token <token>` for token auth\n- The open-douyin API might have an endpoint to get access tokens\n\nLet me try to get an access token via the Open Douyin API first. The standard OAuth2 flow for Douyin open platform should have a client_credentials grant type.\n\nThe Douyin Open Platform API for getting access tokens is typically:\nPOST https://open.douyin.com/oauth/client_token/\nwith params: client_id, client_secret, grant_type=client_credentials\n\nBut this is for the main Douyin platform. For mini-games, the API might be different.\n\nActually, looking at the踩坑记录 more carefully:\n- The CLI tools use `developer.toutiao.com` for auth\n- The new console uses `developer.open-douyin.com`\n- These auth systems don't interop\n\nLet me try a few things:\n1. Try to get an access token via the open-douyin API\n2. Try tmg login with the phone number (but it needs interactive verification code)\n3. Try tma with token auth\n\nActually, the task says \"如果tmg需要cookie登录，尝试用AppSecret通过open-douyin API获取token\"\n\nLet me try the Open Douyin API approach. The standard way for mini-game platforms is:\n- Get access_token via client_credentials or other grant types\n- Use the access_token for API operations\n\nFor Douyin mini-games (小游戏), the API endpoint might be:\nhttps://developer.toutiao.com/api/v2/token\n\nwith params:\n- appid\n- secret\n- grant_type=client_credential\n\nLet me try this.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"33adb7f4-913e-496