{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026052323150075fb35d4075849e8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There are already cookies in the `.tma-cli/.cookies` file! These cookies are from the `developer.toutiao.com` domain (based on the cookie names like `sid_tt_dy_open`, `sessionid_dy_open`, etc.). Let me check if these cookies are still valid.\n\nThe cookies seem to have session IDs that were created recently (the `sid_guard_dy_open` has `1779531559` which is a Unix timestamp). Let me convert that: 1779531559 seconds from epoch = approximately May 22, 2026. The expiry says `5184000` seconds (60 days) and expires on `Wed, 22-Jul-2026`. So the cookies should still be valid.\n\nBut the `tma check-session` says \"未登录\" (not logged in). Let me check the `appConfig.json` to see if the token was stored there, and also see if there's something wrong with the cookies.\n\nActually, wait - the cookies have `dy_open` suffix, which suggests they're from the `open-douyin.com` domain, not `toutiao.com`. The踩坑记录 says \"新旧平台认证不互通\" (new and old platform authentication are not interoperable). The cookies in `.tma-cli/.cookies` have the `_dy_open` suffix which means they're from the open-douyin.com platform, but the tma CLI uses the `developer.toutiao.com` platform for API calls.\n\nLet me check the appConfig.json to see what's stored there.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"33adb7f4-913e-4960-83b6-3354bfda46a0","uuid":"598d5aee-4269-4bbb-8ca5-8ee5452c6c5c"}
